            <title>[PARQUET-1944] Unable to download transitive dependency hadoop-lzo</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1944</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Seems that the solution for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1691&quot; title=&quot;Build fails due to missing hadoop-lzo&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-1691&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-1691&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is not complete. We have to exclude `hadoop-lzo` from the transitive dependencies of `elephant-bird-pig` as well. Not sure why we did not recognize this issue before.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
